# team/ is tracked in the PRIVATE repo (brodie-starter-private). docs/ is included there on purpose.
# team/scripts/submit_to_fork.* publishes team/ WITHOUT docs/ to the public fork. See team/docs/private-repo.md.
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/
*.db
*.db-journal
*.jsonl
*.log
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
web/certs/
recordings/*
!recordings/README.md
*.mp4
*.mov
*.wav
*.npz

# AIST++-derived keys: research terms, never redistributed (rebuild with: python -m team.dance.ingest_aist)
dance/library/aist_*.json
dance/library/class_*.json
dance/library/chain_*.json
